cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this library, its data or its tools, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "WHEELTEC Smart Car Literature Library: evidence library and survey on wheeled mobile robot autonomy under degradation"
authors:
  - family-names: Cai
    given-names: Zhiyuan
repository-code: "https://github.com/EnosElinsa/wheeltec-smart-car-literature"
url: "https://github.com/EnosElinsa/wheeltec-smart-car-literature"
abstract: >-
  An evidence library on wheeled mobile robot autonomy under degradation.
  It holds review cards for 247 assessed publications, coded comparison
  data, evidence codes with source locators, acquisition and transcription
  provenance, validation tools, and the LaTeX sources of a working survey
  manuscript built from the same data.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - wheeled mobile robots
  - autonomous navigation
  - localization
  - motion planning
  - multi-robot systems
  - fault tolerance
  - literature review
  - evidence synthesis
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
